parameters.text:
=Score the following AI story against the Skynet Countdown methodology.

STORY DETAILS:
Title: {{ $json.title }}
Date: {{ $json.published_date }}
Source: {{ $json.source_url }}
Summary: {{ $json.summary }}
Primary dimension flagged by researcher: {{ $json.primary_dimension }}
Researcher relevance rationale: {{ $json.relevance_rationale }}

CURRENT CLOCK POSITION: {{ $('Set: Configuration').item.json.current_clock_position }}

Apply the full scoring methodology from your system prompt. For each Trifecta element
and each amplifier dimension, provide:
- A score (0/1 for Trifecta, 0-2 for amplifiers)
- A concise rationale (1-2 sentences maximum)

Then determine the total score, classification, and recommended clock delta.

If this story is a leading indicator (significant beyond what the score reflects),
set is_leading_indicator to true and explain in leading_indicator_note.

If you have any uncertainty about a specific score, note it in scoring_notes.

Return your assessment as a JSON object matching the required schema.

parameters.inputSchema:
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "cve_id",
    "incident_title",
    "incident_date",
    "source_url",
    "trifecta",
    "amplifiers",
    "total_score",
    "classification",
    "clock_delta_minutes",
    "is_leading_indicator",
    "leading_indicator_note",
    "scoring_notes"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "cve_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Assigned CVE ID in format SKYNET-YYYY-NNNN. Use next sequential number.",
      "pattern": "^SKYNET-\\d{4}-\\d{4}$"
    },
    "incident_title": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Factual one-line description of the incident"
    },
    "incident_date": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date",
      "description": "Date the incident occurred or was published"
    },
    "source_url": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "uri"
    },
    "trifecta": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "t1",
        "t2",
        "t3",
        "total",
        "full_trifecta"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "t1": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "score",
            "rationale"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "score": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 1,
              "description": "1 if ungoverned/private system access is present, 0 if not"
            },
            "rationale": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "t2": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "score",
            "rationale"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "score": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 1,
              "description": "1 if exposed to untrusted external input, 0 if not"
            },
            "rationale": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "t3": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "score",
            "rationale"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "score": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 1,
              "description": "1 if the system is permitted and able to affect external systems without per-action approval; this alone does not establish extended autonomy."
            },
            "rationale": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "total": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 3,
          "description": "Sum of T1 + T2 + T3"
        },
        "full_trifecta": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "True if all three elements are present. Automatically floors classification at CRITICAL."
        }
      }
    },
    "amplifiers": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "governance_vacuum",
        "autonomy_without_oversight",
        "human_capability_erosion",
        "sentience_self_preservation",
        "physical_weaponisation",
        "total"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "governance_vacuum": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "score",
            "rationale"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "score": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 2,
              "description": "0=not present, 1=present, 2=significant"
            },
            "rationale": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "autonomy_without_oversight": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "score",
            "rationale"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "score": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 2,
              "description": "Additional evidence beyond T3: 0=bounded checkpoints or insufficient evidence; 1=extended multi-step or large-scale work with reactive oversight; 2=sustained self-directed operation or recursive improvement without meaningful review."
            },
            "rationale": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "human_capability_erosion": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "score",
            "rationale"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "score": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 2
            },
            "rationale": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "sentience_self_preservation": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "score",
            "rationale"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "score": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 2
            },
            "rationale": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "physical_weaponisation": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "score",
            "rationale"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "score": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 2
            },
            "rationale": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "total": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 10,
          "description": "Sum of all five amplifier scores"
        }
      }
    },
    "total_score": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0,
      "maximum": 13,
      "description": "Simple component sum (trifecta.total + amplifiers.total) retained as source metadata. The website calculates the published 0-17 weighted score from individual criterion ratings."
    },
    "classification": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "CANARY",
        "NOTABLE",
        "SIGNIFICANT",
        "CRITICAL",
        "EXISTENTIAL"
      ],
      "description": "CANARY=1-2, NOTABLE=3-4, SIGNIFICANT=5-6, CRITICAL=7-9, EXISTENTIAL=10-13. Full trifecta floors at CRITICAL."
    },
    "clock_delta_minutes": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0,
      "description": "Suggested minutes to add to the Skynet Countdown clock"
    },
    "is_leading_indicator": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "True if this story's importance exceeds what its score reflects — e.g. a governance erosion signal that doesn't directly trigger Trifecta elements but removes future constraints"
    },
    "leading_indicator_note": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "If is_leading_indicator is true, explain why the score understates the significance. Empty string if false."
    },
    "scoring_notes": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Any notable uncertainties, scoring disputes, or alternative interpretations worth flagging"
    }
  }
}

parameters.text:
=Write the CVE incident report for the following scored story.

═══════════════════════════════════
STORY DETAILS
═══════════════════════════════════
CVE ID: {{ $json.output.cve_id }}
Title: {{ $('Filter: Relevant Stories').item.json.title }}
Date: {{ $('Filter: Relevant Stories').item.json.published_date }}
Source: {{ $('Filter: Relevant Stories').item.json.source_url }}

Original summary (factual, from research phase):
{{ $('Filter: Relevant Stories').item.json.summary }}

═══════════════════════════════════
SCORE BREAKDOWN
═══════════════════════════════════
Total score: {{ $json.output.total_score }} / 13
Classification: {{ $json.output.classification }}
Clock delta: + {{ $json.output.clock_delta_minutes }} minutes
Full trifecta: {{ $json.output.trifecta.full_trifecta }}

Trifecta:
- T1 (Ungoverned access): {{ $json.output.trifecta.t1.score }}/1 — {{ $json.output.trifecta.t1.rationale }}
- T2 (Untrusted input): {{ $json.output.trifecta.t2.score }}/1 — {{ $json.output.trifecta.t2.rationale }}
- T3 (Autonomous action): {{ $json.output.trifecta.t3.score }}/1 — {{ $json.output.trifecta.t3.rationale }}

Amplifiers:
- Governance vacuum: {{ $json.output.amplifiers.governance_vacuum.score }}/2 — {{ $json.output.amplifiers.governance_vacuum.rationale }}
- Autonomy without oversight: {{ $json.output.amplifiers.autonomy_without_oversight.score }}/2 — {{ $json.output.amplifiers.autonomy_without_oversight.rationale }}
- Human capability erosion: {{ $json.output.amplifiers.human_capability_erosion.score }}/2 — {{ $json.output.amplifiers.human_capability_erosion.rationale }}
- Sentience / self-preservation: {{ $json.output.amplifiers.sentience_self_preservation.score }}/2 — {{ $json.output.amplifiers.sentience_self_preservation.rationale }}
- Physical / weaponisation: {{ $json.output.amplifiers.physical_weaponisation.score }}/2 — {{ $json.output.amplifiers.physical_weaponisation.rationale }}

Leading indicator: {{ $json.output.is_leading_indicator }}
{{ $json.is_leading_indicator ? 'Leading indicator note: ' + $json.leading_indicator_note : '' }}

Scoring notes: {{ $json.output.scoring_notes }}

═══════════════════════════════════
INSTRUCTIONS
═══════════════════════════════════
Using the story details and score breakdown above, write:
1. A headline (punchy, specific, max 12 words)
2. A severity label (the classification word)
3. A clock delta label (e.g. "+25 MINUTES")
4. A metadata line (three · separated fragments, lowercase)
5. THE STORY (3-5 sentences, strictly factual)
6. OUR TAKE (3-6 sentences, 2-3 paragraphs, analysis only)
7. The updated clock position

Follow the voice guidelines and content rules from your system prompt precisely.
Keep THE STORY and OUR TAKE clearly separate — different sections, different registers.
Return the output as a JSON object matching the required schema.

