      "type": "string",
      "description": "3-6 sentences across 2-3 paragraphs. Why this moves the clock. Analysis only — no re-stating facts from THE STORY. Uses the Skynet Countdown voice: dry, technically precise, occasionally darkly funny. Never panicked. Never dismissive. Ends with a single-sentence verdict."
